        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Door Springlatch Assembly for Weslock Door Knobs</b>\r\n<p>\r\nFor Privacy and Passage function Weslock <b>Door Knobs</b>. \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking such as a bathroom door.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/keyed-entry-function-door-knob-latch-for-weslock\">Weslock Deadlatch</a> for Keyed Entry Door Knob (door knobs with lock cylinder inside).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWeslock 600 series. For use with <a href=\"/collections/weslock-molten-bronze-collection\">Weslock Molton Bronze Collection</a>, <a href=\"/collections/weslock-elegance-collection\">Weslock Elegance Collection</a> and <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection\">Weslock Traditionale Collection</a>, <b>Door Knobs</b> (not door levers) and <b>Entry Handles with Door Knobs</b>. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Note: </b>If you have a Weslock Door Lever use, <a href=\"/products/privacy-and-passage-function-door-lever-latch-for-weslock\">Weslock Door Lever Latch</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAdjustable  for both 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" backsets. <br>\r\nPackaged with both Radius and Square corner face plates.\r\n</p>",
